---
---

<section class="relative pt-20 pb-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-slate-200/80 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-6">
      Open specification · Public draft v1.0 · CC-BY-4.0
    </p>

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-[1.1]">
          Run your business with AI agents, without getting locked in.
        </h1>

        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          YAIBOS is an open spec for an AI business OS. Your company context, procedures (SOPs) and tools live in plain Markdown files you own. Any AI harness can run them, from Claude Code to Codex, and you can switch harness or model without rewriting anything.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          This site also grades the tools that exist today against the spec, so you can see what to use now and what is still missing.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-2 text-sm">
          <a
            href="/spec"
            class="px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold transition-colors">
            Read the spec
          </a>
          <a
            href="/implementations"
            class="px-6 py-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 font-semibold transition-colors">
            See the scorecard
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- The v1 idea in one picture: vault -> harness -> model -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6 space-y-3 text-sm">
          <div class="rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 p-4">
            <div class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Your vault <span class="font-normal text-slate-500">(Markdown + git, you own it)</span></div>
            <pre class="mt-2 font-mono text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">├── AGENTS.md   company context
├── SOP/        procedures
├── Tools.md    MCP servers, CLIs
└── Areas/      knowledge</pre>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center text-slate-400" aria-hidden="true">↓ synced to</div>
          <div class="rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 p-4">
            <div class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Any harness <span class="font-normal text-slate-500">(replaceable)</span></div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-slate-600">Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, Gemini CLI, or a desktop app built on one of them.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center text-slate-400" aria-hidden="true">↓ uses</div>
          <div class="rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 p-4">
            <div class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Any model <span class="font-normal text-slate-500">(replaceable)</span></div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-slate-600">Through each person's own AI plan or API key.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
